<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Travelers Property restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Travelers Property restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it restarted coverage of Travelers Property Casualty Corp with intermediate-term neutral and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed Thursday at 41-1/4.</p>
